A fresh task-6acdf9f6 instance supplied varied demos: some showed isolated singleton noise removed, some showed a singleton intrusion removed from a solid rectangle, while intact regions remained. These examples did not establish a sufficiently precise shared trigger for a complex test. Eight output submissions based on combinations of preserving blocks, removing noise, and repairing rectangle defects were rejected.

