Before deciding to request another demonstration for a recurring ARC task, inspect any linked references relevant to its task ID or pattern. Prior analyses may document that a particular test remained unresolved, that earlier demo requests did not identify the missing motif parameters, or that certain tempting extrapolations were rejected. Treat these notes as warnings and evidence about what remains uncertain—not as a validated solution for the current input.

